# Fundraising ops E2E — already passed

SELPIC admin (ops) already ran the locked partner cycle and it processed normally:

Apply → Approve… → Save welcome pack (D2→D3→D4) → Lookup OTP → change request → D22 notice → Documents download / reply → admin Save (D16/D17 if bank changed) → Mark applied → Mark Paid (blocked without Official Grant Account, then paid with bank on file).

## Do not

- List this as “code exists, no run recorded” or “Go-live QA not closed”
