## Re-run only if

A later change **touches** apply persist, welcome pack order, Lookup OTP, change-request/D22, admin bank Save, or Mark Paid/D9/D10 — and the user asks to verify that change.

The 19 Aug 2026 personalised-sample apply checkbox is **opt-in, default off**. It does **not** invalidate the passed cycle. Do not re-run E2E for that alone.

